    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"It is my dream to see midwifery thriving in Pakistan, and for that I am willing to contribute everything in my capacity,\" said Professor Rafat Jan, a graduate of the Aga Khan University School of Nursing's inaugural class in 1983, while presenting a generous donation to the School on its 40 th  anniversary.",
